title: "ChatGPT OneDrive Personal writable compatibility research"
type: software
version: "1.1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-05"
authors:
  - name: "mattek8"
    website: "https://github.com/mattek8"
repository-code: "https://github.com/mattek8/chatgpt-onedrive-personal-workaround"
url: "https://github.com/mattek8/chatgpt-onedrive-personal-workaround"
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  Independent validation of writable OneDrive Personal (Microsoft Account / MSA)
  behavior from ChatGPT. The project records the August 2026 seed-based fallback
  developed when the SharePoint/OneDrive connector exposed an incomplete MSA
  action surface, and the September 2026 revalidation showing native personal-drive
  search, folder creation, upload, listing, move/rename and delete primitives working
  end-to-end on the tested account.
keywords:
  - ChatGPT
  - OneDrive Personal
  - Microsoft Graph
  - Microsoft Account
  - MSA
  - SharePoint connector
  - document store
  - workaround
  - connector compatibility
